<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain leaves rate unchanged at 6.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain leaves rate unchanged at 6.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said on Tuesday it left its key money rate unchanged at 6.75 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 4.965 trillion pesetas against 4.975 trillion bid.</p>
<p>All ten economists polled by Reuters on Monday had expected the Bank of Spain to hold its key money rate steady.</p>
</text>
